  m_text: 'Match 3 symbols on the CENTER LINE to WIN!


    SEVEN  x3  ->  JACKPOT!  
    (150x bet)

    BELL   x3  ->  BELL BONUS (20x) + Free Spins

    BAR    x3 
    ->  Big Win    (10x bet)

    CHERRY x3  ->  Win         (5x bet)

    BELL  
    x2  ->  Small Win   (2x bet)


    Click the LEVER to spin (default bet 50G).

    Or
    select your bet anytime from the BET MENU.'
